   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Umbrella Body of irish Development NGOs. incl.research</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Dochas is the umbrella association of Irish NGOs working on overseas development and humanitarian assistance. D&#xf3;chas facilitates a number of Working Groups which allow its members to share expertise of the latest development practice. These include Humanitarian Aid, Policy, Disability in Development, Development Education, Finance, Governance and Compliance, COVID19 leadership, Safeguarding and Results and are chaired by a representative of one of its members. D&#xf3;chas are also active in promoting political and public support for the development programme, developing best practice guidelines on safeguarding and other governance issues, and engaging on EU/UN issues.</narrative>
  </description>
